sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant VM as VM in a spoke
  participant FW as Hub firewall (DNS proxy)
  participant RES as DNS Private Resolver (inbound)
  participant AZ as Azure DNS and Private DNS zones
  participant DC as Domain controllers
  VM->>FW: query (spoke VNet DNS = firewall IP)
  FW->>RES: forward to resolver inbound IP
  alt privatelink name, e.g. Key Vault
    RES->>AZ: resolve from the hub VNet (zone linked)
    AZ-->>RES: private endpoint IP
  else AD domain, e.g. corp.example.com
    RES->>DC: forwarding ruleset via outbound endpoint
    DC-->>RES: AD DNS answer
  else public name
    RES->>AZ: Azure-provided DNS
    AZ-->>RES: public answer
  end
  RES-->>FW: answer
  FW-->>VM: answer
